Cari (GROUP+HAVING), padam self-join kekalkan satu, cegah UNIQUE (punca diselesaikan, bukan gejala!). Transaksi + sandaran sebelum padam pukal. `USING` MySQL/Postgres sintaks self-delete.

```sql
CREATE TABLE audit (bila timestamptz DEFAULT now(), siapa text, aksi text, jadual text, lama jsonb, baharu jsonb);
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION catat() RETURNS trigger LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$
BEGIN
  INSERT INTO audit(siapa, aksi, jadual, lama, baharu)
  VALUES (current_user, TG_OP, TG_TABLE_NAME, row_to_json(OLD), row_to_json(NEW));
  RETURN COALESCE(NEW, OLD);
END $$;
CREATE TRIGGER audit_u AFTER INSERT OR UPDATE OR DELETE ON pengguna
FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION catat();
```
Satu fungsi generik semua jadual (`TG_*` pembolehubah!); JSON fleksibel skema; `COALESCE(NEW,OLD)` kendali DELETE (NEW tiada!). Jadual audit dipartition (membesar pantas!) + dasar retensi.
